{{define "actions_list.tmpl"}}
AVAILABLE ACTIONS:

NOTE: The actions below are core commands currently implemented by the agent-server.
For comprehensive details on ALL available game actions, mechanics, and advanced features,
reference: https://www.spacemolt.com/skill.md and https://www.spacemolt.com/api.md

MOVEMENT & NAVIGATION (Action Commands - Consume Tick):
- "undock" - Leave the current station (no target needed)
- "dock" - Dock at the current POI (no target needed)
- "travel" - Move to a different POI within your CURRENT SYSTEM (requires target: EXACT POI ID from available POIs list)
- "jump" - Make a hyperspace jump to a DIFFERENT STAR SYSTEM (requires target: system name from available connections list)

CRITICAL NAVIGATION RULES:
  • Use "travel" to move between locations (POIs) in the system you're already in
  • Use "jump" to travel between star systems using the hyperspace connections
  • POIs are locations within a system (stations, asteroid fields, planets)
  • Connections are hyperspace routes to other star systems

CRITICAL: When using "travel", you MUST use the EXACT POI ID shown in the "AVAILABLE POIs" list.
Do NOT invent, modify, or reformat POI IDs. Copy them character-for-character including underscores.

RESOURCE GATHERING (Action Commands - Consume Tick):
- "mine" - Mine resources at current location (no target needed)
- "scan" - Scan the current area (no target needed)

INFORMATION QUERIES (Query Commands - No Tick Consumption):
- "get_status" - Get player status including ship, cargo, location (no target needed)
- "get_system" - Get current system info including POIs and connections (no target needed)
- "get_ship" - Get detailed ship specifications and modules (no target needed)
- "get_skills" - Get your skill tree and progression status (no target needed)
- "get_cargo" - Get detailed cargo inventory (no target needed)
- "get_poi" - Get information about current POI (no target needed)
- "get_base" - Get information about docked station (no target needed)
- "get_map" - Get your discovered star systems (no target needed)

SPECIAL:
- "wait" - Wait and do nothing (no target needed)

IMPORTANT: Actions consume a ~10 second tick. Queries do not. Choose wisely based on your
current situation and goals. Pay close attention to server responses - they contain crucial
information about success/failure, resources gained, damage taken, and available options.
